WEBVTT

00:10:27.283 --> 00:10:30.459
We know that we can manage
our fisheries sustainably.

00:10:30.459 --> 00:10:32.101
We know that we can produce

00:10:32.101 --> 00:10:35.870
healthy meals for hundreds of millions of people

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.115
that don't use the land, that don't use much water,

00:10:38.115 --> 00:10:39.300
have a low carbon footprint,

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.102
and are cost-effective.

00:10:41.102 --> 00:10:43.090
We know that saving the oceans

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.673
can feed the world,

00:10:44.673 --> 00:10:47.060
and we need to start now.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.817
(Applause)

00:10:49.817 --> 00:10:53.525
Thank you. (Applause)